parameters.content:
LiveKit / calling bridge service is webhook ko POST karega jab bhi caller kuch bole (per-turn), body shape:
{ call_id, caller_phone, caller_name, query }

Response wapas JSON milega:
{ reply, booking_confirmed, end_call }

Bridge service 'reply' ko TTS se bolwaye. Same AI brain (Hotel AI Assistant) WhatsApp chatbot wala hi use ho raha hai - isliye dono jagah jawab consistent rahenge.
